    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Witch and Beast】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Life in the Era</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>I heard there is a magical storybook near the Tingen Grand Theater; go try to find it.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>After your Acting level reaches <Assistant_Red>Level 30</>, head to {Location:[廷根(1068,996)]|6816;-314;-1868;2;5200002;0} and pick up the storybook to trigger the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognitive Experience, Bound Sol, invoices, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure progress"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Witch and Beast】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Life in the Era</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>I heard there is a magical storybook near the Tingen Grand Theater; go try to find it.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>After your Acting level reaches <Assistant_Red>Level 30</>, head to {Location:[Tingen(1068,996)]|6816;-314;-1868;2;5200002;0} and pick up the storybook to trigger the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognitive Experience, Bound Sol, invoices, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure progress",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>永屹之城</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>休闲-城堡\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>城堡总评分达到5000分"] = "<Assistant_Title1>City of Eternal Standing</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Leisure - May Manor · Castle\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Reach a total Castle rating of 5000 points",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>盛装登台</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>冒险-队伍副本\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>通关乌托邦剧院困难难度"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Dressed for the Stage</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Adventure - Team Dungeon\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Clear Utopia Theater on Hard difficulty",
    ["<Highlight>序列权柄：</>\n奇迹、诡秘、愚弄、历史\n\n<Highlight>核心能力：</>\n愚弄命运、时间与历史，在历史迷雾中追溯过往、窥探未来。掌控诡秘变化，游走于灵界深处，于绝境中创造奇迹。是命运的玩笑者，时间的愚弄者，以诡秘之力愚昧现实法则，在不可能中创造可能。"] = "<Highlight> Sequence Authority: </> \n Miracle, Mystery, Fooling, History \n \n <Highlight> Core Ability: </> \n Fools fate, time, and history, tracing the past and peeking into the future within the fog of history. Controls mysterious changes, roams deep within the Spirit World, and creates miracles in desperate situations. It is the joker of fate, the fooler of time, using mysterious power to fool the laws of reality and creating possibilities within the impossible.",
    ["<P_Heart>（松鼠语）</>它发出笑声……很轻，却让我灵体颤抖……它说……它已经收割了好多灵魂……这次也……势在必得……"] = "<P_Heart> (Squirrel language) </> It laughed... very softly, but it made my spirit body tremble... It said... it had already harvested many souls... and this time too... it was determined to succeed...",
    ["<P_Heart>（神色凝重）</>……一个被诅咒的港口。"] = "<P_Heart> (Looks solemn) </>... A cursed port.",
    ["<P_Yellow>小丑</>：别担心，你不会像我一样失控的……大概吧？嘻嘻嘻！"] = "<P_Yellow>Clown</>: Don't worry, you won't lose control like me... probably? Hehehe!",
    ["　　让我猜猜……你肯定在想'这些牌到底怎么走'对不对？    \n　　放心，就算你不懂扑克，我也不会嘲笑你~\n 　　作为一个负责的主持人，我还是准备了这本宝典——《傻瓜都能懂的牌经》！\n\n 　　所谓<Letter_Highlight>顺子</>，就是连续的5个数字，比如：4-5-6-7-8。\n 　　明白了吗？必须一个跟一个，不能跳着来！也<Letter_Highlight>不能反悔！</>\n\n 　　花色？在这里，爱情不分种族~红心、黑桃、方块、梅花，混着来都行！\n 　　重要的只有<Letter_Highlight>数字顺序</>，记住了吗？\n\n 　　如果你踩错了……嘻嘻，你会摔下去，摔下去，再摔下去！\n\n 　　——爱你的解说员，小丑 敬上"] = "    Let me guess... You must be thinking 'how do these cards move', right?    \n    Don't worry, even if you don't understand poker, I won't laugh at you~\n     As a responsible host, I have prepared this treasure book—《Card Sutra for Dummies》!\n\n     The so-called <Letter_Highlight>Straight</> is 5 consecutive numbers, for example: 4-5-6-7-8.\n     Understand? They must follow one after another, no skipping! And <Letter_Highlight>no taking it back!</>\n\n     Suits? Here, love knows no race~ Hearts, Spades, Diamonds, Clubs, mix them all you want!\n     The only thing that matters is the <Letter_Highlight>numerical order</>, got it?\n\n     If you step wrong... hee hee, you will fall, fall, and fall again!\n\n     ——Yours truly, the commentator, Clown",
